      "writtenOn": "2022-04-18T19:22:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The devicetree defines all the power signals used by the AP power sequence code.  The power signals are categorized based on their function with respect to the EC.\n* Electrical signals monitored by the EC are power signal inputs. This includes power good indicators generated by board logic and status indicators generated by the AP.\n* Electrical signals driven by the EC are power signal outputs. This includes signals to enable power rails, and to signals connected to the AP that indicate when power rails are stable.",
